# Terraform

**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example


# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored.
# It is committed so provider versions are reproducible in CI.

# Creds/Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials
kubeconfig
kubeconfig-*
.kube/
.kubeconfig

# Golang app
bin/
dist/
*.test
*.out
vendor/
# The compiled binary. `go build` in app/ writes ./app, which is a 29 MB
# executable that was tracked for a while: it went into every Docker build
# context and got scanned by Trivy as part of the source tree.
/app/app

# Junk
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
*.swp